# E2E Testing Patterns

## Playwright Setup
```typescript
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';

test('user login flow', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/login');
  await page.fill('[name="email"]', 'user@example.com');
  await page.fill('[name="password"]', 'password');
